{% doc %}
  @prompt
    IMPORTANT:
    - Do NOT include the human/person shown in the reference image.
    - The section should be designed specifically for a plant nursery / plant e-commerce website.
    - All plant/product images must be selectable through Shopify's Theme Editor using image upload/picker options.
    - Do NOT hardcode image URLs.
    - Make the section fully responsive for desktop, tablet and mobile.
    
    SECTION LAYOUT:
    
    1. MAIN SECTION
    - Full-width horizontal section.
    - Use a soft warm cream/off-white background.
    - Add a subtle decorative abstract radial/sunburst shape in the background on the right side.
    - Keep the overall design clean, premium and modern.
    - Rounded corners where appropriate.
    
    2. PRODUCT CAROUSEL
    Create a horizontally scrollable product carousel on the left/middle area.
    
    Display 3 plant product cards at a time on desktop.
    
    Each product card should contain:
    
    TOP AREA:
    - Large product image.
    - Image must be selectable/uploadable from Shopify Theme Editor.
    - Image should automatically fit inside the image area without distortion.
    - Rounded top corners.
    - Bestseller badge at top-left.
    - Discount badge at top-right.
    
    PRODUCT DETAILS:
    - Small rating badge such as:
      ★ 4.8 | 440
    - Product title.
    - Short product description.
    - Current price.
    - Original price with strikethrough.
    - Discount percentage.
    - Circular dark-green Add to Cart icon/button at bottom-right.
    
    Example content:
    Product 1:
    Title: Peace Lily Plant
    Description: Stunning air-purifying plant
    Price: ₹299
    Original Price: ₹350
    Discount: 15% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 440
    
    Product 2:
    Title: Anthurium Red Plant
    Description: Long-lasting indoor plant
    Price: ₹699
    Original Price: ₹800
    Discount: 13% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 111
    
    Product 3:
    Title: Jade Mini Plant
    Description: Easy-care lucky succulent
    Price: ₹249
    Original Price: ₹300
    Discount: 17% OFF
    Rating: 4.8
    Reviews: 414
    
    3. SHOPIFY CUSTOMIZATION OPTIONS
    
    In the Shopify Theme Editor, provide settings for each product card:
    
    - Product image upload/picker
    - Product title
    - Product description
    - Current price
    - Original price
    - Discount text
    - Bestseller badge ON/OFF
    - Bestseller text
    - Rating
    - Review count
    - Product link
    - Add to cart button
    - Card background color
    
    Allow at least 6 product cards to be added dynamically using Shopify blocks.
    
    Each block should have its own image picker.
    
    4. CAROUSEL FUNCTIONALITY
    
    - Desktop: show 3 cards.
    - Tablet: show 2 cards.
    - Mobile: show 1 card with part of the next card visible.
    - Add a circular dark-green right arrow button overlapping the carousel.
    - Add a left arrow as well, but keep it subtle.
    - Smooth horizontal sliding animation.
    - Touch/swipe support on mobile.
    - Do not use external carousel libraries.
    - Use lightweight JavaScript/CSS.
    - Infinite or smooth looping is preferred.
    - Disable arrows when there are no more slides if infinite looping is not used.
    
    5. DESIGN STYLE
    
    Use a premium nursery / botanical visual style.
    
    Colors:
    - Dark green: #1F5130
    - Yellow/golden accent: #FFD60A
    - Cream background: #FFF9E8
    - White product card: #FFFFFF
    - Muted gray for secondary text.
    
    Typography:
    - Product titles should have a slightly elegant serif style.
    - Descriptions and prices should use a clean modern sans-serif font.
    - Use responsive font sizes.
    
    6. IMAGE SETTINGS
    
    VERY IMPORTANT:
    Every product card must have a Shopify image picker.
    
    Example schema structure:
    
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "product_image",
      "label": "Plant Image"
    }
    
    The uploaded image should be displayed dynamically.
    
    Also provide an optional image picker for:
    - Background/decorative plant image
    - Optional promotional image
    
    Do NOT use the human image from the reference.
    
    7. HOVER EFFECT
    
    When the user hovers over a product card:
    - Slightly lift the card.
    - Add a subtle shadow.
    - Plant image should have a very subtle zoom effect.
    - Add-to-cart button can slightly scale.
    - Keep the animation smooth and premium.
    - Do not make the animation excessive.
    
    8. ADD TO CART
    
    The circular shopping-bag/cart button should work with Shopify's cart functionality.
    
    If the block is connected to a Shopify product:
    - Clicking the button should add the selected product to cart.
    - Use Shopify's product/variant information.
    - If necessary, provide a product selector in the Theme Editor.
    
    Provide:
    - Product selector
    - Variant support
    - Add-to-cart functionality
    
    9. RESPONSIVE DESIGN
    
    Desktop:
    - 3 product cards visible.
    - Cards should have equal width.
    - Carousel occupies approximately 65–70% of the section.
    - Leave enough breathing space around the cards.
    
    Mobile:
    - One card visible at a time.
    - Horizontal swipe carousel.
    - Product cards should remain visually large.
    - Hide unnecessary decorative elements.
    - Keep prices and buttons easy to tap.
    - No horizontal page overflow.
    
    10. CODE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Generate a complete Shopify Online Store 2.0 section.
    with add to cart button will be position as right bottom corner of the plant product, i need plant with price ,description and rating and one more is add to cart button with link and view all products with link
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;width:{{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;max-width:100%;padding:32px;background:{{ block.settings.background_color }};border-radius:20px;color:#14231a}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:20px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading{margin:0;color:#1f5130;font:clamp(25px,3vw,38px)/1.2 Georgia,serif}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all{padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #1f5130;border-radius:24px;color:#1f5130;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track{display:flex;gap:18px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;scroll-behavior:smooth;scrollbar-width:none;padding:4px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex:0 0 calc((100% - 36px)/3);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;scroll-snap-align:start;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 5px 18px #1b372314}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media{aspect-ratio:1/.88;background:#f0eee5}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;padding:15px;position:relative}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating{font-size:12px;color:#244c2e;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title{font:20px Georgia,serif;color:#1f5130;margin:8px 0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc{font-size:13px;color:#5b6660;margin:0}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price{margin-top:auto;padding-top:12px;color:#1f5130;font-size:18px;font-weight:700}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart{position:absolute;right:14px;bottom:12px;width:42px;height:42px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#1f5130;color:white;cursor:pointer}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status{font-size:13px;color:#39443c}@media(max-width:989px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:calc((100% - 18px)/2)}}@media(max-width:600px){.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}{padding:22px 15px}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card{flex-basis:84%}}
{% endstyle %}
<plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__head"><h2 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__heading">{{ block.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>{% if block.settings.view_all_link != blank %}<a class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__all" href="{{ block.settings.view_all_link }}">{{ block.settings.view_all_label | escape }}</a>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__track">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign image_id = 'image_' | append: i %}{% assign product_id = 'product_' | append: i %}{% assign title_id = 'title_' | append: i %}{% assign desc_id = 'description_' | append: i %}{% assign rating_id = 'rating_' | append: i %}{% assign reviews_id = 'reviews_' | append: i %}{% assign price_id = 'price_' | append: i %}{% assign link_id = 'link_' | append: i %}{% assign image = block.settings[image_id] %}{% assign product = block.settings[product_id] %}{% assign title = block.settings[title_id] | default: product.title %}<article class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__card"><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__media">{% if image %}<img src="{{ image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ image.alt | default: title | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ image.width }}" height="{{ image.height }}">{% elsif product.featured_image %}<img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}" alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div>{{ 'product-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</div><div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__body">{% assign rating = block.settings[rating_id] %}{% assign reviews = block.settings[reviews_id] %}{% if rating != blank %}<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__rating">★ {{ rating }}{% if reviews != blank %} | {{ reviews }}{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}<h3 class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__title">{% assign link = block.settings[link_id] %}{% if link != blank %}<a href="{{ link }}">{{ title | escape }}</a>{% elsif product != blank %}<a href="{{ product.url }}">{{ title | escape }}</a>{% else %}{{ title | escape }}{% endif %}</h3>{% assign desc = block.settings[desc_id] %}{% if desc != blank %}<p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__desc">{{ desc | escape }}</p>{% endif %}{% assign price = block.settings[price_id] %}<div class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__price">{% if price != blank %}{{ price | escape }}{% elsif product != blank %}{{ product.price | money }}{% endif %}</div>{% assign variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant %}{% if variant != blank %}<button class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart" type="button" data-variant="{{ variant.id }}" aria-label="Add {{ title | escape }} to cart">+</button>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div><p class="ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p></plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(()=>{const tag='plant-products-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class Plants extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.status=this.querySelector('.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__status');this.addEventListener('click',this.add)}disconnectedCallback(){this.removeEventListener('click',this.add)}add=async e=>{const b=e.target.closest('.ai-plants-{{ ai_gen_id }}__cart');if(!b)return;b.disabled=true;this.status.hidden=false;this.status.textContent='Adding plant to cart…';try{const root=window.Shopify?.routes?.root||'/';const response=await fetch(root+'cart/add.js',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Accept':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({items:[{id:Number(b.dataset.variant),quantity:1}]})});if(!response.ok)throw new Error('Unable to add product to cart.');location.assign(root+'cart')}catch(error){this.status.textContent=error.message;b.disabled=false}}}customElements.define(tag,Plants)})();</script>
